{"id": "contract-fenced-json", "category": "analysis_contract", "description": "模型把 JSON 包在 ```json 围栏里时，仍能取出对象并解析", "engine": "recorded", "request": {"userMessage": "我理解 TLB 就是页表项的缓存。", "assistantMessage": "是的，TLB 缓存页表项。"}, "llmResponse": "好的，结果如下：\n```json\n{\"evidenceCandidates\":[{\"conceptId\":10,\"evidenceType\":\"USER_EXPLANATION\",\"observation\":\"用户认为 TLB 是页表项缓存\",\"correctness\":\"PARTIAL\"}],\"analyzerVersion\":\"agent-v1\"}\n```", "expect": {"evidence.count": 1, "evidence.types": ["USER_EXPLANATION"], "evidence.conceptIds": [10], "analyzerVersion": "agent-v1", "detectedConcepts": {"op": "contains", "value": "TLB（快表）"}}}
{"id": "contract-malformed-json", "category": "analysis_contract", "description": "模型输出里没有 JSON 对象时，抛 AnalysisError，而不是静默返回空结果", "engine": "recorded", "request": {"userMessage": "我理解 TLB 就是页表项的缓存。"}, "llmResponse": "我觉得用户已经理解了，但这次就不输出 JSON 了吧。", "expectError": {"type": "AnalysisError", "contains": "找不到 JSON"}}
